1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:02,910
Mau cek jadwal? Login dulu.

2
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:06,900
Sudah masuk, jadwalnya di portal lain.

3
00:00:06,950 --> 00:00:12,550
15 menit kemudian, sesi habis? Hahaha, bikin kesel, kan?

4
00:00:12,600 --> 00:00:14,250
Halo, aku Mira.

5
00:00:14,300 --> 00:00:18,650
SIAKAD, MyBest, presensi: biar aku yang atur.

6
00:00:19,050 --> 00:00:20,330
Caranya begini.

7
00:00:20,550 --> 00:00:24,270
Buka mira.muaraai.com, klik Masuk.

8
00:00:24,800 --> 00:00:27,950
Isi NIM, password SIAKAD dan MyBest.

9
00:00:28,600 --> 00:00:33,310
Kode keamanan? Aku yang isi. Sesimu aktif 7 hari.

10
00:00:34,800 --> 00:00:39,600
Kelas berikutnya, tugas, dan IPK: langsung kelihatan.

11
00:00:40,600 --> 00:00:43,510
Jadwal hari ini, atau seminggu penuh.

12
00:00:43,900 --> 00:00:47,430
Lengkap dengan ruang, dosen, dan tombol absen.

13
00:00:48,200 --> 00:00:50,890
Tugas, urut dari deadline terdekat.

14
00:00:51,400 --> 00:00:53,830
Kumpulkan? Tempel link Drive-mu.

15
00:00:53,900 --> 00:00:57,350
Aksesnya aku cek, biar dosen nggak dapat link privat.

16
00:00:59,950 --> 00:01:04,020
Yang baru: Komunitas, ruang ngobrol kelasmu.

17
00:01:04,200 --> 00:01:08,900
Format ala WhatsApp, link YouTube atau Instagram tampil rapi.

18
00:01:09,050 --> 00:01:12,060
Channel, grup, sampai pesan pribadi.

19
00:01:15,000 --> 00:01:18,420
Konsisten di laptop, tablet, sampai HP.

20
00:01:19,300 --> 00:01:22,930
Kontras teksnya tinggi, jadi mata nggak cepat lelah.

21
00:01:24,400 --> 00:01:28,180
Ketuk lonceng di kanan atas, aktifkan notifikasi.

22
00:01:28,900 --> 00:01:31,680
Absen dibuka? Aku langsung kabari.

23
00:01:32,600 --> 00:01:35,770
Ketuk, lalu absen. Tanpa login ulang.

24
00:01:36,300 --> 00:01:38,810
Beres, tercatat di MyBest.

25
00:01:40,600 --> 00:01:44,420
Akunmu aman: password-mu aku enkripsi.

26
00:01:44,550 --> 00:01:47,150
Login berulang? Aku blokir.

27
00:01:47,300 --> 00:01:50,090
Keluar dari semua perangkat? Sekali klik.

28
00:01:50,550 --> 00:01:51,890
Bandingkan sendiri.

29
00:01:52,000 --> 00:01:57,410
Di portal, login tiap 15 menit. Di sini, sekali seminggu.

30
00:01:57,550 --> 00:02:01,750
Di sana jadwal dicari. Di sini, langsung terlihat.

31
00:02:01,900 --> 00:02:04,030
Rapi di layar apa pun.

32
00:02:04,800 --> 00:02:08,820
Gratis, open source, buatan mahasiswa UBSI.

33
00:02:09,000 --> 00:02:14,550
Buka mira.muaraai.com. Sisanya, biar aku yang atur.

